The '''incident on Nevarro'''<ref name="Boba companion">{{InsiderCite|213|Star Wars: The Book of Boba Fett Companion|''Star Wars: The Book of Boba Fett'' Companion}}</ref> was a skirmish that began after the [[mission to Arvala-7]]<ref name="Chapter 3" /> in [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date" /> The [[bounty hunter]] [[Din Djarin]] completed his [[bounty]] by giving [[Din Grogu|Grogu]] to "[[the Client]]" of an [[Gideon's Imperial remnant|Imperial remnant]]. Soon after, he decided to rescue Grogu, which resulted in a firefight between him and [[stormtrooper]]s in their [[Imperial Remnant safe house|facility]]. After Djarin escaped the facility, members of the [[Bounty Hunters' Guild]] led by [[Greef Karga]] confronted him. Neither intending to relinquish, a skirmish broke out between Djarin and the other bounty hunters. Djarin [[Death|killed]] several bounty hunters with his [[Amban phase-pulse blaster]]. Eventually, the Mandalorian group known as [[the Tribe]] joined the battle and helped their fellow Mandalorian escape.<ref name="Chapter 3" />

